{"id": "ST_Trinkets|HardenedFury", "source_en": "Grants the Hardened Fury boon.\n\nAround the doomed churches of Quorum were placed special guard stones. After most of the churches burned, these failed stones retained the heat of the fire, and to this day are passed around in remembrance of that tragedy.", "category": "item", "speaker": null, "ar": "يمنحك بركة الغضب الصلب.\n\nوُضعت أحجار حراسة خاصة حول كنائس كواروم المحكوم عليها بالفناء. بعد احتراق معظم الكنائس، احتفظت هذه الأحجار الفاشلة بحرارة النار، ولا تزال تُتداول حتى يومنا هذا تذكاراً لتلك المأساة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 9}}
{"id": "ST_Trinkets|JudgementsMark", "source_en": "Grants the Judgement's Mark boon.", "category": "item", "speaker": null, "ar": "يمنحك بركة وسم الحكم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 9}}
{"id": "ST_Trinkets|MartyrsGift", "source_en": "Grants the Martyr's Gift boon.\n\nA priest named Olan Blooded died by pagan hands during the second siege of Acktin. So brave was he that he was given a martyr’s burial, and a medallion to wear upon his chest. Two centuries later, the grave was looted, and the medallion stolen. Where it is now no one knows.", "category": "item", "speaker": null, "ar": "يمنحك بركة عطاء الشهيد.\n\nلقي كاهن يدعى أولان بلوديد حتفه على أيدي الوثنيين خلال حصار أكتين الثاني. كان شجاعاً لدرجة أنه نال دفنة الشهداء، وميدالية ليرتديها على صدره. بعد قرنين من الزمان، نُهب القبر وسُرقت الميدالية. لا أحد يعرف مكانها الآن.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 9}}
